      "updated": 1790885159880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 817.8,
      "height": 112.5,
      "text": "Design notes\n1. Topic generation and Whisper STT run in the browser (cost + privacy).\n2. Board defaults to same-origin /api/board so the live site works on any PC.\n3. Evaluation waterfall always ends at a local-strict grader if remote models are unavailable.\n4. Progress is device-local. No user accounts in v0.\n5. FastAPI + Ollama enrich local development; production leaves NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL unset.",
      "originalText": "Design notes\n1. Topic generation and Whisper STT run in the browser (cost + privacy).\n2. Board defaults to same-origin /api/board so the live site works on any PC.\n3. Evaluation waterfall always ends at a local-strict grader if remote models are unavailable.\n4. Progress is device-local. No user accounts in v0.\n5. FastAPI + Ollama enrich local development; production leaves NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL unset.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "seed": 1147,
      "versionNonce": 1148,
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
